ol that helps you  communicate your ideas clearly and  effectively by giving you comprehensive  feedback across different platforms  grammarly does have a free version with  basic grammar and spelling suggestions  but upgrading to their premium version  will actually save you so much time with  their features like tone transforms full  sentence rewrite features  which help you write more clearly by  suggesting different words or  repositioning words and also with their  tone detectors which has been super  helpful for me because sometimes when  you're just trying to get stuff done you  might not realize that you sound like an  and we're in the business of  relationships so these things really do  matter grammarly is free to download and  it's easy to integrate with your  everyday tools like gmail or google docs  just the other day i was getting  pushback from one of our consultants  basically telling us that they weren't  gonna do any more work because it was  outside of their scope and i basically  had to tell them that  yeah  you're right but  we reduced your work and a lot of other  areas plus you were a month late on  delivering your work  so it would be great if you completed  the work please and thank you and  grammarly really helped me craft this  email in a way that was concise  professional and stern and because  navigating these tricky situations are a  really big part of an architect's job  having the writing assistant can save  you so much time get through those  emails quicker by keeping it concise and  confident  and in the right tone with grammarly go  to grammarly.com dammy to sign up for a  free account and get 20 off grammarly  premium to help you work more  efficiently so back to my journey  so that experience working for this firm  after my bachelor's was such an eye  opener for me and i i couldn't believe  that after four years of school i was  still such a snowflake  and i really felt like i had to become  an architect as fast as possible and  